      "text": "The sim2real gap is big both semantically and visually.\n\nAnother example:\n\nReinforcement Learning (excl. recent RLHF for LLMs). It was great for AlphaGo, but the practical applications were very sparse. That being said, every tech co from Uber to Google overplayed their RL tech",
